{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a tiny hero, no bigger than a cat, trying to escape from a hotel overrun by demons from the depths of hell.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your class</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chef (knives, axes, pots), Thief (daggers + critical hits), and more \u2014 each with unique traits and weapon preferences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912900/extras/36f40f39b9cd826660aff9adc5f1ff41.poster.avif?t=1759663489\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912900/extras/36f40f39b9cd826660aff9adc5f1ff41.apng?t=1759663489\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1020 height=152 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u0421rafting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft hearty meals and powerful weapons, then defeat enemies in turn-based battles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912900/extras/2a758b2c224f075df8ad15d7b186aef1.poster.avif?t=1759663489\" width=780 height=157 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912900/extras/2a758b2c224f075df8ad15d7b186aef1.webm?t=1759663489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Random Generation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is unique \u2014 loot rooms, mysterious events, deadly bats, elusive witches\u2026 and many surprises.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add to your wishlist</strong> - be the first to know about the start of the closed playtest!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3912900?t=17